#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API {#set-up-to-use-ibm-quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"
msgstr "Configurer l'utilisation d'IBM Quantum Platform avec l'API REST {#set-up-to-use-ibm-quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can access quantum processors with REST APIs, enabling you to work with QPUs using any programming language or framework.\n"
msgstr "Tu peux accéder aux processeurs quantiques via des API REST, ce qui te permet de travailler avec des QPU dans n'importe quel langage de programmation ou framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get access {#1-get-access}"
msgstr "1. Obtenir l'accès {#1-get-access}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not already have a user account, get one at the [IBM Quantum login page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"
msgstr "Si tu n'as pas encore de compte utilisateur, crées-en un sur la [page de connexion IBM Quantum](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an API key (also called a token) on the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Note that the same API key can be used for either region.\n"
msgstr "Crée une clé API (aussi appelée token) depuis le [tableau de bord](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Note que la même clé API peut être utilisée pour l'une ou l'autre des régions.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Generate an IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) bearer token. This is a short-lived token  used to authenticate requests to the REST API. To generate one, call the [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) as shown in the following sample request:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Génère un token bearer IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM). Il s'agit d'un token de courte durée utilisé pour authentifier les requêtes vers l'API REST. Pour en générer un, appelle l'[API IAM Identity Services](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) comme illustré dans l'exemple de requête suivant :\n"
"<Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Expected Response\n"
msgstr "   Réponse attendue\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "   </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Choose an authentication method {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"
msgstr "2. Choisir une méthode d'authentification {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the appropriate authentication method, depending on your working environment:\n"
msgstr "Choisis la méthode d'authentification appropriée en fonction de ton environnement de travail :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an environment variable for your API key (trusted Python environments)](#environment_variable)\n"
msgstr "[Créer une variable d'environnement pour ta clé API (environnements Python de confiance)](#environment_variable)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Use your API key directly (untrusted environment)](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"
msgstr "[Utiliser ta clé API directement (environnement non fiable)](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an environment variable (trusted environment) {#create-an-environment-variable-trusted-environment}"
msgstr "Créer une variable d'environnement (environnement de confiance) {#create-an-environment-variable-trusted-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the IQP_API_TOKEN environment variable in your system, you can add the following line to your shell profile (for example, .bashrc or .zshrc) or by setting it directly in your terminal:\n"
msgstr "Pour définir la variable d'environnement IQP_API_TOKEN sur ton système, tu peux ajouter la ligne suivante à ton profil shell (par exemple, .bashrc ou .zshrc) ou la définir directement dans ton terminal :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    When you invoke the environment variable in your code, include `import os`, as in this example:\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Lorsque tu invoques la variable d'environnement dans ton code, inclus `import os`, comme dans cet exemple :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Note that when creating an environment variable, your API key is still stored locally in plain text, and should be safeguarded.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Note que lors de la création d'une variable d'environnement, ta clé API est toujours stockée localement en texte clair et doit être protégée.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate requests to the REST API by including the CRN and bearer token to the request's headers.\n"
msgstr "Authentifie les requêtes vers l'API REST en incluant le CRN et le token bearer dans les en-têtes de la requête.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Optional: Configure your firewall {#3-optional-configure-your-firewall}"
msgstr "3. Optionnel : Configurer ton pare-feu {#3-optional-configure-your-firewall}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
msgstr "    Si nécessaire, utilise [ces informations](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) pour activer l'accès aux points de terminaison de l'API IBM Quantum.\n"

